# A1: the AUDITED eight-seat 262k attach and exactness smoke on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-stack-audit (the nine levers' audits, the singles audit 'all', the verify T1/T2 audits, the in-trace sampler REMOVED, plus the shard
# argmax, the drafter conv and the drafter heads each with its audit). Never attached on hardware. READ in order and stop at the first failure: (1) 'packed-any admission passed ... capacity=262144', 'kv reservation installed'
# with num_gpu_blocks=19968, extent block engaged blocks=2; (2) the fused commit engaged on BOTH blocks, the verify-glue markers; (3) '[PINDIAG] tp4 shard argmax engaged' and 'shard argmax audit N exact=True' lines, '[PINDIAG] tp4 draft conv engaged'
# and 'draft conv audit exact=True', '[PINDIAG] tp4 draft heads engaged' and 'draft heads audit exact=True' (the drafter audits cover each site's first two capture buckets: the second quad block is held by the singles audit), and no 'fell back' line;
# (4) ZERO audit mismatches anywhere (verify T1/T2, extent, fused commit, vglue, draft singles: an equal=1 line for each of the groups [0, 1, 2, 3] and [4, 5, 6, 7]); (5) concurrent8_steady: exactly two quad markers (slots 0,1,2,3 and 4,5,6,7), a round both quads served,
# no pooled-refused, fallback or disable line; (6) every answer's hash equal to the control attach's (the 262k8 window's S0c on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-gate, or this window's earlier run of it) and to solo, accepted tokens and verify rounds per request equal. Record the memory ledger's free DRAM per chip at eight live seats.
# Duration (estimate): 120 min. Stop rule: a failure here skips every lever arm that depends on it.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/262k8-x experiments window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/262k8-x and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-x-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/262k8-x commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-x-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-stack-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code,concurrent8_steady,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
